    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105762" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῡχ-ηρός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ragged, tattered, worn out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυχηρὰ περὶ τρυχηρὸν . . χρόα
					λακίσματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					496
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>wearing, tormenting, grievous,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυχηρᾷ καὶ πολυμερίμνῳ βασάνῳ
				περιπεσόντες</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				109.1
			</span></i>.</div>
